  "details": "Imagine if Dolly Cam could record two versions of the same VRChat video simultaneously: the normal recording and a green screen version. This would make editing much easier, especially in worlds where the Roto Brush (a tool used to separate a subject from its background), in After Effects or CapCut struggles because of lighting, particle effects, or busy backgrounds.\n\nHaving an automatic green screen version would give editors much more creative freedom, allowing them to seamlessly combine characters with different environments, visual effects, and cinematic edits without spending hours masking footage.",
